{
  "_comment": "Presentation-attribute and marker vectors shared by every SVG sanitiser in the ecosystem. The cases rows started as TestPresentationAttributeValueGuards in ichava/icon-sets-sync (src/internal/core/svg/presentation_test.go, #85); the marker rows and the documents section were added when <marker> was allowed, after the US and UM flags shipped without their stars. Every sanitiser asserts the same keep or strip decision for each case, and runs each document through its full sanitiser: a document with clean true must come out with nothing removed, one with clean false must lose something (a stripper removes it, a rejecting generator refuses the document), and every expect row holds of the output wherever the output exists. This file is byte-identical in icon-sets-sync (src/internal/core/svg/testdata), core, react-icon-browser and js-icon-components. Change it in all four together.",
